+7. After the loop, compute the total number of occupied points:
+   $$
+   \text{nb\_of\_pts} = \sum \text{occupancy\_mat}
+   $$
+8. Append a final level to `mipmap` containing `nb_of_pts` as a single scalar tensor.
 
